<view class="page"><view class="club-page-banner"><view class="club-eyebrow">BERLIN FC</view><view class="club-banner-title">导出战术图片</view><view class="club-banner-subtitle">生成 · 预览 · 保存到本机</view><image class="club-banner-mark" src="/assets/team-badge.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view><page-state skeleton-type="detail" loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="refresh"/><block wx:if="{{!loading&&!error}}"><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="hint export-source">{{source}} · 竖屏初始画布</view><view class="card export-options"><view class="hint">生成 PNG 图片或单页 A4 图片型 PDF，不含可编辑图形。仅在本机处理，不自动分享或申请相册权限。</view><view class="export-buttons"><button id="tactic-export-png" class="primary ui-button" bindtap="png" disabled="{{loading || (busy)}}" size="mini">生成 PNG</button><button id="tactic-export-pdf" bindtap="pdf" disabled="{{loading || (busy)}}" class="ui-button" size="mini">生成 PDF</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{ready}}" class="export-result"><view class="hint export-ready">临时文件已生成，离开此页会清理。请另存完成备份。</view><view class="export-result-actions"><button id="tactic-export-preview" bindtap="preview" disabled="{{loading || (busy)}}" class="ui-button ui-block" size="mini">预览 {{format}}</button><button id="tactic-export-save" bindtap="saveLocal" disabled="{{loading || (busy)}}" class="primary ui-button ui-block" size="mini">保存到本机</button></view></view><image wx:if="{{pngPath}}" class="preview" mode="aspectFit" src="{{pngPath}}"/><view wx:if="{{message}}" class="hint">{{message}}</view><view wx:if="{{actionError}}" class="error">{{actionError}}</view></block><canvas hidden="{{businessUiBlocking}}" id="export-canvas" type="2d" class="export-canvas"/></view>
<business-dialog id="business-dialog"/>
